OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Holocaust victim
OL,4,Arecognised at Auschwitz
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe name of a Scot who died in the
OL,7,FHolocaust after refusing to abandon
OL,8,FJewish children in her care has been
OL,9,Fadded to a special memorial wall at
OL,10,FAuschwitz.
OL,12,FJane Haining is recognised in a renewed
OL,13,Fsection of the Auschwitz Birkenau
OL,14,FMemorial and Museum's main exhibition -
OL,15,Fdevoted to hundreds of prisoners for
OL,16,Fwhom no registration photographs were
OL,17,Ftaken.
OL,19,FThe new name plaques adorn the wall of
OL,20,Fa long corridor and are displayed next
OL,21,Fto many images of prisoners dressed in
OL,22,Fstriped shirts with shaved heads.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
