OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Holocaust victim
OL,4,Arecognised at Auschwitz
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaining's death certificate said she
OL,7,Fdied in hospital on 17 July 1944, aged
OL,8,F47, but it is widely accepted she died
OL,9,Fin a gas chamber and her remains are on
OL,10,Fthe Auschwitz site.
